# =====================================================================================================
# TalentLoop FRONTEND environment (React + Vite)
# =====================================================================================================
#
# The frontend holds NO secrets. The Vapi public key, model names and server status come from the
# backend at run time. The only frontend setting is where the backend is.
#
# ---- Vercel: Project > Settings > Environment Variables (Production, Preview and Development) -------
#
# Your backend's address (the Render service URL or its custom domain). No trailing slash needed.
# Vercel forwards /api/... and /media/... to it (frontend/middleware.ts), so the browser talks to one
# address and sign-in cookies work. After adding or changing it, redeploy.
BACKEND_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
#
# Also set APP_URL on the BACKEND (Render) to your Vercel address, e.g. https://talentloop.vercel.app,
# so candidate interview links point to the Vercel site.
#
# ---- One Render service (no Vercel): nothing to set. The backend serves the website itself. ---------
#
# ---- Local development (npm run dev): nothing to set. Vite forwards /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000. ---
